    <node id="&quot;GERHARD MEIDELL GERHARDSEN (1848–1912)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gerhard Meidell Gerhardsen (1848–1912) was a Norwegian bailiff and politician for the Conservative Party. He was born at the farm Roalstvedt in Kvinnherred and served as a bailiff and held various roles including municipal council member and chairman of the savings bank Moster Sparebank."</data>
